-- TESTING -------------------------------------------------------------------
  Tested      NexClash differential verification against two machine-played
              recordings and unit cases over every graphic, both builds;
              simulated boot; run from its menu in OverSpec. Not on real
              hardware.

  Replay      two machine-played recordings (40164 frames, 14 games), both
              builds: every register with R and all memory at every hook,
              26818 figures and 2796472 sprite pixels identical; 3264 unit
              cases over all 34 types

  Emulator    OverSpec: from the patch menu with a trainer and Enhanced on,
              the loading screen, the game's menu and play

  Nothing here claims a result on real hardware unless the line above says so.

-- HOW TO USE ----------------------------------------------------------------
  Put this .nxc and the game file in the same folder on the Next's card and
  choose the .nxc in the Browser. See README.txt.
